# S1-P0 z-calibration coupons: reproducible with
#   python mujoco_arm/tools/build_shoulder_z_coupons.py
# The STL binaries stay out of the repo: this checkout cannot add new LFS
# objects (the git-lfs filter cannot start, sh.exe fails with Win32 error 5).
# design.json / manifest.json carry volume, bbox and triangle count instead.
# ASCII only on purpose: the rest of this file is GBK and must stay one encoding.
**/shoulder_z_coupons/*/coupon.stl
# S1 deltoid Y envelope: reproducible with
#   python mujoco_arm/tools/build_deltoid_y_module.py
# Same constraint as the z coupons: no new LFS objects can be added from this
# checkout, so design.json / s1_deltoid_y.json carry volume, component count and
# triangle count and the binary is regenerated on demand.
**/shoulder_deltoid_y/*.stl
# S1 module envelopes: reproducible with
#   python mujoco_arm/tools/build_shoulder_modules.py
# Same LFS constraint as the z coupons and the deltoid envelope.
**/shoulder_modules/*.stl
